{"logId": "f5205f9b-e0e7-4d7a-84d9-a3653b107124", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "勇敢面对困难和挫折，脚踏实地、永不放弃，踏踏实实做好每一件小事。", "block_bbox": [208, 149, 1489, 196], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[208.0, 149.0], [1489.0, 149.0], [1489.0, 196.0], [208.0, 196.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "八、我们的愿景：创造财富、播撒文明、分享快乐", "block_bbox": [132, 213, 1029, 260], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[132.0, 213.0], [1029.0, 213.0], [1029.0, 260.0], [132.0, 260.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 创造财富", "block_bbox": [182, 276, 394, 322], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 276.0], [394.0, 276.0], [394.0, 322.0], [182.0, 322.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "包括物质财富和精神财富，我们用自己的辛勤劳动和聪明智慧，发掘自己的潜能，展示自己的才华，体现自己的人生价值，为自己、为顾客、为社会、为人类创造更多的物质财富和精神财富；", "block_bbox": [181, 338, 2539, 451], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 338.0], [2539.0, 338.0], [2539.0, 451.0], [181.0, 451.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不仅要学会创造财富，更要合理地支配财富，真正发挥它应有的价值，使自己的生活越来越好，做财富的主人，不做财富的奴隶！", "block_bbox": [215, 463, 2501, 512], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[215.0, 463.0], [2501.0, 463.0], [2501.0, 512.0], [215.0, 512.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "● 播撒文明", "block_bbox": [181, 526, 393, 572], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 526.0], [393.0, 526.0], [393.0, 572.0], [181.0, 572.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 我们应当是文明的使者，美的传播者，用我们的一片爱心，营造一个优良环境，净化小环境，影响大环境；", "block_bbox": [182, 589, 2105, 636], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 589.0], [2105.0, 589.0], [2105.0, 636.0], [182.0, 636.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑ 在自己生活品质提高的基础上，在力所能及的情况下，去关爱别人、传播爱，使自己成为爱的使者！", "block_bbox": [183, 652, 1984, 699], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 652.0], [1984.0, 652.0], [1984.0, 699.0], [183.0, 699.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "分享快乐", "block_bbox": [186, 715, 398, 761], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[186.0, 715.0], [398.0, 715.0], [398.0, 761.0], [186.0, 761.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“财散人聚，财聚人散”，快乐和财富一样都是越分越多，能够和更多的人分享快乐，我们才更快乐，更有价值！", "block_bbox": [239, 777, 2224, 827], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 777.0], [2224.0, 777.0], [2224.0, 827.0], [239.0, 827.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1718, 1333, 2383, 1682], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[1718.0, 1333.0], [2383.0, 1333.0], [2383.0, 1682.0], [1718.0, 1682.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "-9", "block_bbox": [2633, 1892, 2674, 1920], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[2633.0, 1892.0], [2673.0, 1892.0], [2673.0, 1919.0], [2633.0, 1919.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8506115078926086, "coordinate": [208, 149, 1489, 196], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[208.0, 149.0], [1489.0, 149.0], [1489.0, 196.0], [208.0, 196.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8716145157814026, "coordinate": [132, 213, 1029, 260], "order": 2, "polygon_